falco
------------------------------------------
C++ implementation of FastQC for quality control of sequencing data

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libdeflate0-1.26-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libhts3-1.25-1bl1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libdeflate-devel-1.26-1
  libhts-devel-1.25-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  samtools-1.25-1bl1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/smithlabcode/falco

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/smithlabcode/falco/archive/refs/tags/v2.0.3.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack falco-2.0.3-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./falco-2.0.3-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/falco-2.0.3-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/falco-2.0.3-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(falco)
  /usr/bin/falco.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/falco.README
  /usr/share/doc/falco/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/falco/LICENSE.CLI11
  /usr/share/doc/falco/LICENSE.boost
  /usr/share/doc/falco/README.md
  /usr/share/falco/FastQC_DATA_LICENSE
  /usr/share/falco/README.md
  /usr/share/falco/adapter_list.txt
  /usr/share/falco/contaminant_list.txt
  /usr/share/falco/limits.txt

